  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Space is filled with more than just heat, and your powers take advantage of that.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Solarian level 1st.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Choose either cold, electricity, or acid damage. Any of your Solarian abilities which deal fire damage instead deal that type of damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat can be taken multiple times, allowing you to choose which type of damage you deal with each attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/starfinder-to-pathfinder#toc61\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
